stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> OFFLINE

    OFFLINE --> BOOTSTRAP: RTSP 유효 프레임 연속 수신
    BOOTSTRAP --> EMPTY: ROI 준비 + no person
    BOOTSTRAP --> OCCUPIED_CALM: ROI 준비 + person
    BOOTSTRAP --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    EMPTY --> OCCUPIED_CALM: person probe 확인
    EMPTY --> BURST: interaction-zone rapid motion
    EMPTY --> BOOTSTRAP: scene change / ROI invalid
    EMPTY --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    OCCUPIED_CALM --> BURST: rapid motion / fast skeleton change
    OCCUPIED_CALM --> EMPTY: person TTL 만료 + empty confirm
    OCCUPIED_CALM --> BOOTSTRAP: scene change / ROI invalid
    OCCUPIED_CALM --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    BURST --> VERIFY: fall evidence
    BURST --> OCCUPIED_CALM: 안정 + candidate 없음
    BURST --> EMPTY: person 없음 확인
    BURST --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    VERIFY --> ALERT: confirmation criteria 충족
    VERIFY --> RECOVERY: safe/recovered/insufficient evidence
    VERIFY --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    ALERT --> RECOVERY: alert hold 종료
    ALERT --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

    RECOVERY --> OCCUPIED_CALM: person 안정
    RECOVERY --> EMPTY: person TTL 만료
    RECOVERY --> BURST: renewed rapid motion
    RECOVERY --> OFFLINE: frame timeout

